:: Fishing Coast Path Clothing Toss
<<effects>>
You wring out the <<= $fishingClothingName>> and stow it away. You'll throw it away when you get back to town.
<<unset $fishingClothingName>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Coast Path Clothing Keep
<<effects>>
<<set _clothingResult to fishingFindClothingItem($fishingClothingName)>>
<<generalSend "wardrobe" _clothingResult.slot $fishingClothingName _clothingResult.colour>>
You wring it out and stow it away.
<<unset $fishingClothingName>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Coast Path Wait]]>><</link>>


